<title>BELGIUM: Belgian unemployment 13.4 pct in Feb - minister.</title>
<headline>Belgian unemployment 13.4 pct in Feb - minister.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Employment Minister Miet Smet said in a statement on Tuesday that unemployment fell to 13.4 percent of the working population in February from 13.6 percent in January.</p>
<p>A year ago, in February 1996, Belgium's unemployment rate was 14.3 percent, she said.</p>
<p>Belgium's employment ministry is due to release a breakdown of the unemployment figures later on Tuesday or Wednesday.</p>
